  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Guru Pado Thakur vs The State Of Jharkhand And Others .... ... on 6 April, 2023 Author: Sanjay Kumar Dwivedi Bench: Sanjay Kumar Dwivedi In The High Court Of Jharkhand, Ranchi ---- W.P.(Cr.) No.116 of 2016 ---- Guru Pado Thakur, s/o late Gosai Das, proprietor of M/s Bengali Sweets, At-Old B.D.O. Office, Bermo (Phusro), P.O. -Dhori, P.S.-Bermo, District- Bokaro (Jharkhand) .... Petitioner -- Versus -- The State of Jharkhand and Others .... Opposite Parties. ---- Coram: Hon'Ble Mr. Justice Sanjay Kumar Dwivedi --- For the Petitioner :- Mr. Mukesh Kumar, Advocate For the Resp. State :- Mr. Ravi Kerketta, Advocate ---- 9/06.04.2023",
    "facts": "",
    "arguments": "The learned counsel for the respondent State submits that by notification dated 13.7.2020 the appellate authority has already been notified in view of the said Act and the Principal District and Sessions Judge of the concerned district as well as Judicial Commissioner for Ranchi district have been notified as appellate authority in view of the said notification.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "The learned counsel for the respondent State submits that by notification dated 13.7.2020 the appellate authority has already been notified in view of the said Act and the Principal District and Sessions Judge of the concerned district as well as Judicial Commissioner for Ranchi district have been notified as appellate authority in view of the said notification.",
